\
The natural extension is an **individual switching controlled linear dynamical system**:\
\
\\[\
x_\{i,t+1\}\
=\
A_\{i,z_t\}x_\{i,t\}\
+\
B_\{i,z_t\}u_t\
+\
\\epsilon_\{i,t\},\
\\]\
